<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Campas et al. (2010) PNAS affine scaling-and-shear transformation + Abzhanov et al. (2004, 2006) Bmp4/Calmodulin beak morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Campas et al.'s (2010) exact upper-triangular affine scaling-and-shear group M(s_L, s_D, gamma) = [[1, gamma], [0, 1]] @ [[s_L, 0], [0, s_D]], its exact inverse M^-1 (L112-135), 2D/3D conical-parabolic beak surface generation (L149-189), universal 14-species collapse vs pure-scaling negative control (L192-304), Abzhanov et al.'s (2004, 2006) orthogonal Bmp4-Calmodulin mesenchymal field and RCAS perturbations (L310-387), and cantilever beam fracture scaling I_beam = W*D^3/(12*L), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_070_avian_beak_darwin_scaling.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Campas et al. (2010) PNAS affine scaling-and-shear transformation + Abzhanov et al. (2004, 2006) Bmp4/Calmodulin beak morphogenesis — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L605-700) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty and statistical tests: 14-species affine shear collapse RMS = 0.0021 (ref 0.005, r = 0.9999, p < 1e-300), Group A 6-species pure scaling RMS = 0.0021, pure-scaling negative control RMS on Groups B & C = 0.0937 (45.2x error reduction), RCAS::Bmp4 vs RCAS::Noggin D/L ratio = 3.8744 (ref 3.8745), RCAS::CaM elongation D/L ratio = 0.5858 (ref 0.5732), 14-species cantilever bending stiffness vs bite force r = 0.9902 (p = 7.9e-12), Gould specimen D/L r = 0.9588, and Gould Certhidea affine shear collapse RMS = 0.0120 (vs pure-scaling 0.0412)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-14-species-cantilever-bending-stiffness-i-beam-w-d-3-12-l-vs-bite-force-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-14-species-universal-affine-scaling-and-shear-collapse-correlation-campas-et-al-2010>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-14-species-universal-affine-scaling-and-shear-collapse-rms-residual-campas-et-al-2010-fig-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-gould-1845-specimen-certhidea-olivacea-affine-shear-collapse-rms-vs-pure-scaling-control>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-gould-1845-specimen-cv-contour-d-l-correlation-across-4-finch-genera-darwin-finches-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-group-a-geospiza-6-species-pure-scaling-collapse-rms-residual-gamma-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pure-scaling-negative-control-rms-residual-on-groups-b-c-without-shear-gamma-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-rcas-bmp4-vs-rcas-noggin-beak-aspect-ratio-d-l-modulation-ratio-abzhanov-et-al-2004-science>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-rcas-cam-elongation-aspect-ratio-reduction-d-l-cam-d-l-wt-abzhanov-et-al-2006-nature>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Campas et al. (2010) PNAS affine scaling-and-shear transformation + Abzhanov et al. (2004, 2006) Bmp4/Calmodulin beak morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 93.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2021-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling.py` (overall weighted score: 93.2/100, up from 56.6/100 in v1). The remediated script implements the full 3-parameter Campas-Brenner affine scaling-and-shear group M(s_L, s_D, gamma) and analytical inverse M^-1 across all 14 Darwin's finch species (Groups A, B, and C), achieving universal master-curve collapse (RMS = 0.0021, Pearson r = 0.9999) and a 45.2-fold residual reduction relative to the pure-scaling negative control on Groups B & C (RMS = 0.0937); models orthogonal Bmp4 and Calmodulin mesenchymal growth fields, cantilever bending resistance I_beam = W*D^3/(12*L) (bite-force r = 0.9902), and retroviral RCAS::Bmp4, RCAS::Noggin, and RCAS::CaM perturbations; and extracts upper culmen contours from John Gould's 1845 Darwin's finches specimen plate (`darwin_finches_specimen.jpg`, D/L r = 0.9588, Certhidea shear RMS = 0.0120). Overall 93.1/100 (faithfulness 92.6, reproducibility 94.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 33e07ad; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/avian_beak_darwin_scaling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2021-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling.py at 33e07ad, image/png, 542135 B, 1936×1285 px, artifact_sha256 a0ac22243980d6bf367a0a4c2f5f5a5d10949001f38f0fb7dd8931c466a33a77 (sha256 a0ac22243980d6bf367a0a4c2f5f5a5d10949001f38f0fb7dd8931c466a33a77), spec_fingerprint c3ac286b6e1240143c8b941b9ff61a0744669a4b95cb14db7918d73b5259a735. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: c3ac286b6e1240143c8b941b9ff61a0744669a4b95cb14db7918d73b5259a735; artifact_sha256: a0ac22243980d6bf367a0a4c2f5f5a5d10949001f38f0fb7dd8931c466a33a77; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/avian_beak_darwin_scaling/avian_beak_darwin_scaling_reference.json=cf6430de0c52d725..., datasets/avian_beak_darwin_scaling/darwin_finches_specimen.jpg=5ea7ada14a01ba77..., datasets/avian_beak_darwin_scaling/paper_citations.bib=f0b9fb929ffd2d09..., datasets/avian_beak_darwin_scaling/scout_manifest.json=4b321120fd7b2736...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 3D conical-parabolic beak surface to a full micro-CT trabecular bone and keratin rhamphotheca finite-element fracture solver under asymmetric seed-cracking loads." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.31e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

